AUDIO: 'media queue. Three kinds of input are accepted. Raw dual fisheye.nsv from Insta360 and .osv from DJI, both cameras and drones. Stitched 360 equirectangular material and ordinary flat 2D video and images.'

[01:42] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: The 360 Gaussian Pro interface displaying two fisheye camera views and frame extraction settings.
AUDIO: 'In my testing, exteriors came out better with equirectangular input, and interiors with raw fisheye, but it depends on your material. I recommend starting with a 2-to-3 minute video with'

